.TH SDE-SETTINGS 1 "October 2026" "SDE 0.1 Alpha" "Selviana Desktop Environment"
.SH NAME
sde-settings \- settings for the Selviana Desktop Environment
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sde-settings
[\-\-page appearance|panel|desktop|about] [\-\-version]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBsde-settings\fR changes the theme (light or dark), accent color, icon theme, fonts, wallpaper, panel and desktop options. Changes apply immediately to running SDE programs.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-page " name"
Open the given page.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/xdg/sde/sde.conf
System-wide default settings.
.TP
.I ~/.config/sde/sde.conf
Per-user settings, written by \fBsde-settings\fR(1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sde-session (1),
.BR sde-panel (1),
.BR sde-desktop (1),
.BR sde-settings (1)
.SH BUGS
SDE 0.1 is an alpha release. Please report problems at
https://github.com/hugomonizdorego/SDE-Desktop/issues
